OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWet and
OL,6,Fwindy at first but rain turning to
OL,7,Fshowers with some clear conditions
OL,8,Ftoo. Continuing showery overnight with
OL,9,Fa stiff westerly wind moving the
OL,10,Fshowers through.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA blustery day with showers
OL,13,Fand strong, gusty winds, perhaps some
OL,14,Fshelter up for Ayrshire with less
OL,15,Fshowers here.
