OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FStarting
OL,6,Fshowery again Sunday but brightening
OL,7,Fup and winds easing in the afternoon,
OL,8,Fa pleasant end to the weekend. Some
OL,9,Fspells of rain and westerly winds for
OL,10,Fthe new week.
